+-----------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------

Audio
=====

${PKGSTEM} uses QSoundEffect from qt6-multimedia. This requires
pipewire, which is installed with ${PKGSTEM} as a run dependency.
Pipewire doesn't autospawn, so before launching ${PKGSTEM}, you need to
run:

	$ /usr/local/bin/pipewire &

if this isn't taken care of by your desktop manager or in your startup
scripts like .xsession.
